  - m_Id: 22140940561932288
    m_Localized: Host missing VR mod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22141160662228992
    m_Localized: 'The host does not appear to have the VR mod installed.


      Some
      VR features may not work, or have degraded functionality.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22141383878893568
    m_Localized: It is what it is
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22142401945526272
    m_Localized: 'RepoXR tried to launch the game in VR, however an error occured
      during initialization.


      You will still be able to play the game and
      make use of this mod''s features, however you will not be in VR.


      You
      can disable VR in the settings if you want to suppress this error in the future.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22142412309651456
    m_Localized: Alright fam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22142419381248000
    m_Localized: VR Startup Failed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22153268758044672
    m_Localized: VR Development Build
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22153422554783744
    m_Localized: Let me play!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 22153575793680384
    m_Localized: 'You are using a development build of RepoXR. This build is not
      finished and might contain bugs or other unforeseen "features".


      Enter
      with caution.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
